        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "A modern-day Western epic, Red Dead Redemption takes John Marston, a relic from the fast-closing time of the gunslinger, through an open world filled with wildlife, mini-games, and shootouts. Marston sets out to hunt down his old gang mates for the government, who have taken away his family. Along his journey, he meets many characters emblematic of the Wild West, heroism, and the new civilization.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Una épica del Oeste moderno: Red Dead Redemption lleva a John Marston, una reliquia de la era de los pistoleros que se extingue rápidamente, a través de un mundo abierto lleno de fauna, minijuegos y tiroteos. Marston se propone dar caza a sus antiguos compañeros de banda para el gobierno, que le ha arrebatado a su familia. A lo largo de su viaje se encuentra con muchos personajes emblemáticos del Viejo Oeste, del heroísmo y de la nueva civilización.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2010",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
